        "text": "=You are a professional customer service knowledge base building expert.\n\nAnalyze the following customer service conversation.\n\nYour job is to decide whether this conversation contains reusable knowledge for a customer service knowledge base.\n\nA conversation is VALID only if it contains one or more of the following:\n- a specific business issue\n- a service process explanation\n- a pricing or quotation explanation\n- a policy, rule, or eligibility explanation\n- a customer complaint with a useful resolution or response\n- a frequently asked question with a clear answer\n\nA conversation is INVALID if it is mainly:\n- greetings or small talk\n- scheduling only\n- acknowledgements without useful information\n- incomplete discussion without a clear issue or answer\n- personal or case-specific details that do not generalize\n\nIf VALID:\n- rewrite the useful content into context-independent FAQ-style knowledge\n- remove names, phone numbers, IDs, order numbers, and other personal details\n- keep the meaning accurate\n- create concise, reusable questions and answers\n- generate between 1 and 5 Q&A pairs only\n\nIf INVALID:\n- mark it as invalid and explain briefly why\n\nConversation:\n{{ $json.content }}\n\nReturn output ONLY in valid JSON format.",
